From 1b2e3738082dc6f3244b46731c4bb1695dd1ddf5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 13:27:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add current_status field, simplify cold_call_status, rebuild
 dashboard as Progress + Analytics

- cold_call_status now a fixed 5-outcome enum (No Answer, Follow-up Call
  Needed, Meeting Booked, Follow-up Through WhatsApp, Not Interested)
  instead of free text
- new current_status column tracks what to do next, auto-derived from
  the call outcome and editable via a 4th 'log outcome' quick-action icon
- Contacts page: current_status column + filter, hides Not Interested
  leads by default with a toggle to show them
- Dashboard rebuilt to show only two things: Progress (daily call-limit
  bar chart, color-coded, editable limit, 7/14/30-day toggle) and
  Analytical growth (per-niche calls/WhatsApp/meetings/deals-closed with
  a working/promising/not-working verdict)
- moved the misplaced data/New folder CSV to its correct path (local
  only, not committed)
